      <h2>📊 What is ABC Analysis?</h2>
      <p>ABC Analysis helps you categorize menu items based on <strong>sales volume and profitability</strong>, allowing you to focus on what truly drives revenue.</p>

      <ul>
        <li>🅰 <strong>A-Category</strong> – Top-performing items that generate the most revenue. Focus on maintaining quality, consistency, and strategic pricing.</li></br>
        <li>🅱 <strong>B-Category</strong> – Supporting items that contribute steadily to profitability. Optimize pricing, marketing, and positioning.</li></br>
        <li>🅲 <strong>C-Category</strong> – Least profitable items with minimal impact. Consider improving, repositioning, or removing them.</li></br>
      </ul>

      <p>Use ABC Analysis to <strong>optimize menu pricing, reduce waste, and maximize profitability.</strong></p>
  </div>
